{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40218096\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究可穿戴外骨骼对帕金森病步态的辅助效果，但未涉及FOG、STN神经活动或DBS机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40219650\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究左旋多巴不敏感型FOG的胆碱能机制，可作为解释FOG异质性及STN之外竞争性机制的重要证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40221482\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究下丘脑以外的下丘及中脑运动区调控和药物诱导僵直，未涉及STN或PD冻结步态。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40235161\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者PPN胆碱能神经元退变及步态障碍，可为STN之外的脑干步态调控机制提供交叉证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40237970\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"系统综述和荟萃分析涉及PD步态及运动功能的皮层神经调控，可辅助理解STN之外的运动网络机制，但未专门研究FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40241492\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"讨论PD双任务步态干扰及前额叶神经调控，可辅助分析认知负荷和皮层网络对FOG的潜在影响。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40244843\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究PD患者FOG的量化评估及ON/OFF状态下的步态特征，可用于FOG表型定义、测量方法和状态依赖性分析。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40245688\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究可穿戴设备对FOG的实时检测，可为不同STN神经活动研究提供客观FOG事件识别和测量方法方面的参考。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40253429\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究STN高频DBS引起的神经元去同步化及GABA异步释放机制，是解释STN神经活动与DBS效应关系的重要基础研究，但未直接测量FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40255894\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD胆碱能核团结构改变与运动亚型的关系，可辅助分析PPN等非STN网络对运动障碍异质性的贡献。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40256685\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究PD患者FOG与前庭反射的关系，提供感觉运动整合机制方面的阴性证据，可用于比较FOG的竞争性解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40261028\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究对象为嗜银颗粒病及进行性核上性麻痹相关冻结步态，而非PD或STN相关FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40269077\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究左旋多巴对转身动力学及FOG严重程度的影响，可辅助分析药物状态、转身任务和FOG之间的交互关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40288787\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究非侵入性振动提示设备改善PD症状的临床试验方案，未涉及STN神经活动或FOG特异性机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40293010\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究半自由生活环境下的FOG传感器检测，可为FOG客观识别及神经活动与行为事件的时间关联分析提供方法学参考。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40301366\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究节律性听觉刺激对PD日常步行的促进作用，未涉及STN、DBS或FOG神经机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40302702\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"讨论DBS术后颈髓病导致步态障碍的问题，可作为区分DBS相关步态恶化与神经环路性FOG的临床鉴别证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40302787\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要讨论多巴胺在学习与运动中的功能理论，未涉及STN神经活动、DBS或FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40304115\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者跌倒风险预测及临床变量，未提供STN神经活动与FOG之间的直接或明确间接证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40304274\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述PD运动干预的疗效响应者特征，包括神经调控干预，可辅助分析DBS疗效及患者个体差异的潜在来源。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40309805\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究大鼠腹侧被盖区和黑质纹状体通路的运动控制，与PD患者STN神经活动及FOG缺乏直接联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40326633\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"系统综述计算机视觉在运动障碍及PD步态评估中的应用，可能包含FOG客观识别和表型测量方面的交叉证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40329003\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"在帕金森病动物模型中直接记录STN神经活动，可提供STN异常活动及其调控机制的基础证据，但研究终点为情绪行为而非FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40337155\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要研究动作观察训练对多种疾病步态和姿势平衡的康复效果，未涉及STN或FOG神经机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40348851\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究健康小鼠次级运动皮层对自主运动的神经编码，与PD、STN及FOG缺乏直接联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40351562\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述高强度聚焦超声及其与DBS的比较，并讨论步态不稳等不良反应，可辅助理解功能神经外科干预相关的步态变化，但未直接研究STN活动与FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40352729\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究小鼠纹状体MC4R神经元与情绪及运动控制的关系，未涉及PD、STN或FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40356882\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者运动训练期间的EEG特征与运动强度关系，但未涉及FOG、STN特异性活动或DBS。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40358908\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要研究晚期PD患者的症状体验及生活质量，未提供STN神经活动与FOG关系的机制性证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40368423\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究晚期PD患者阿扑吗啡持续皮下注射治疗的临床案例，未显示与STN神经活动或FOG机制的明确关联。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2de7acbe-9def-4755-9ba5-0c67175d462e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T150346352702Z", "elapsed_seconds": 110.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T15:05:36.389527+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a107181e544592de4f4db3447602f8c9adb2b49f5e667cac7948d4ed18ec5f0d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T150346352702Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "b1ad9a612e8ac35eba5b651fd796dc6de86867bdbfb06489d1cc7ccd681e4fe2"}}}
